  ml-free-tree msg-putchar msg-puts-attr msg-puts-attr-len msg-start msg-use-printf out-char peekchr
  redrawing reg regatom safe-vgetc screen-valid screenalloc typed-ahead u-freebranch
  u-freeheader ui-breakcheck update-topline vgetorpeek vim-iswordc-buf? vpeekc wait-return win-update)

